        "jsCode": "return [\n  {\n    json: {\n      recipient_name: \"Suresh (Test)\",\n      recipient_email: \"sureshkumar20133151@gmail.com\",\n      company_name: \"My Tech Co\",\n      subject: \"Quick question regarding custom AI & automation workflows\",\n      personalized_message: \"Hi Suresh,\\n\\nI noticed you are exploring automation and custom development workflows. I specialize in building custom n8n pipelines and AI assistants.\\n\\nWould you be open to a quick 5-minute chat next week to see if we can streamline your processes?\\n\\nBest regards,\\nSuresh Kumar\\nSoloDeveloper.pro\"\n    }\n  }\n];"
